  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>In the first step ethyl benzene undergoes electrophilic substitution reaction to form&nbsp;1-Bromo-4-ethylbenzene.</p><p>In the next&nbsp;step&nbsp;1-Bromo-4-ethylbenzene undergoes free radical substitution at benzylic position followed by dehydrohalogenation(last step) in presence of alcoholic KOH to form 4-bromo styrene.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/d21191c7-7593-49f2-8a81-7c48c7ad3639-Untitled.png\" style=\"width: 430px; height: 510px;\" /></p>",
